  "description": "The Queen of our vintage collection. The Ladies Deluxe Bike is everything you could want in a ladies vintage bike, designed with an upright riding position and ever-elegant frame-style for increased rider comfort. A premium riding experience for those who want it all.\nThe redesigned frame exudes elegance while the cream-coloured tyres complete the retro bike style for ladies. You’ll sit comfortably upright with the higher, swept-back handlebars. This makes weekend cruising a breeze. The Ladies Deluxe bike is low-maintenance thanks to its Shimano 3-Speed Hub, meaning the chain is protected and so are your clothes.\nAdd an optional front basket to complete the look and have all the storage you’ll need for a day out to the shops or a picnic in the park.",
